{
  "slug": "haytham",
  "name": "Haytham",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Lifecycle control plane for AI-built products. Takes a startup idea and produces a validated, specified, architected, implementation-ready system through four phases: validate the idea with market and competitor research, define MVP scope and capabilities, make architecture and build-vs-buy decisions, and generate implementation-ready OpenSpec files. Orchestrates 10 specialist agents that build a traceable reasoning graph from founder intent to production specs. Every requirement traces to a capability, every capability traces to a user need.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **12 agents**, **7 commands** and **2 hooks**.\n\n- **Agents** (12): `architect` (Analyze build-vs-buy decisions, produce architecture decisions, and generate pre-implementation research directives for non-standard capabilities), `capability-checker` (Adversarial review of the capability model against the approved MVP scope), `capability-modeler` (Transform MVP scope into a structured capability model and classify system traits), `competitor-researcher` (Research competitors for a startup idea using web search), `feasibility-screener` (Comparatively score all scout problem candidates on 5 dimensions in a single pass, under a hard web-search budget,…), `idea-analyst` (Gate a raw startup idea, expand it into a structured concept, and extract the concept anchor that anchors…), `idea-scout` (Extract up to 5 problem-anchored candidates from a normalized harvest of pain sources (low-star app reviews, Stack Exchange…), `market-researcher` (Research the market landscape for a startup idea using web search), and 4 more\n- **Commands** (7): `build` (Set up a new project from Phase 4 specs, ready for implementation), `design` (Run Phase 3 (HOW) - Produce build/buy analysis and architecture decisions), `haytham` (Validate a startup idea and produce an implementation-ready specification), `plan` (Run Phase 4 (SPECS) - Generate implementation-ready OpenSpec), `scout` (Autonomous daily idea scout - extract problems from a harvest, screen them with a solution angle, deep dive…), `specify` (Run Phase 2 (WHAT) - Define MVP scope and capability model from a validated idea), `validate` (Run Phase 1 (WHY) - Validate a startup idea with market research and produce a GO/PIVOT/NO-GO recommendation)\n- **Hooks** (2): `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install haytham@claude-community` from `arslan70/haytham`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "agent": 12,
    "hook": 2,
    "command": 7
  },
  "sourceType": "community",
  "author": {
    "name": "Arslan Mehboob"
  },
